<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V PAKISTAN BOARD XI SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ZIMBABWE V PAKISTAN BOARD XI SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>SAHIWAL, Pakistan 1996-10-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the</p>
<p>second day of the three-day match between Zimbabwe and Pakistan</p>
<p>Cricket Board XI on Sunday:</p>
<p>Zimbabwe first innings 307-7 declared (D. Houghton 105, A.</p>
<p>Flower 100 not out, S. Nazir 3-42, A. Sohail 2-32)</p>
<p>Pakistan Board XI first innings (overnight 8-0)</p>
<p> Aamir Sohail c sub b Whittal			23</p>
<p> Shadab Kabir lbw b Olonga			   46</p>
<p> Sohail Jaffar c Dekker b Whittal		   8</p>
